OL,3,GNEWSA'Quantity of petrol' but no
OL,4,Aexplosives found in three vehicles near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FA quantity of petrol but no explosive
OL,8,Fdevices were found during searches of
OL,9,Fthe three vans near RAF Fairford in the
OL,10,Fwest of England, counter-terror police
OL,11,Fhave said.
OL,13,FFive men, all UK nationals in their
OL,14,F20s, were arrested on suspicion of
OL,15,Fexplosives offences and later terrorism
OL,16,Foffences after the vehicles were
OL,17,Fspotted in the early hours of Sunday,
OL,18,Fsparking a major security incident
OL,19,Faround the base which is operated by
OL,20,Fthe US military.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
