OL,3,GNEWSA'Quantity of petrol' but no
OL,4,Aexplosives found in three vehicles near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey were released on bail the
OL,8,Ffollowing day in what police described
OL,9,Fas an "investigative decision" which
OL,10,Fwas "grounded in experience and
OL,11,Fstrategy".
OL,13,FIt comes after US Secretary of State
OL,14,FMarco Rubio said it was clear a
OL,15,F"foreign actor" had been involved.
